This project contains code derived from CivNexus6 by deliverator23
(https://github.com/deliverator23/CivNexus6).

Specifically, cli/civhash.cpp was extracted from CivNexus6's
ConsoleApplication1.cpp:

  - the crc32_table and the ComputeHash / calculate_crc32 routines
  - the bone hierarchy hash (calculate_bone_hierarchy_hash) semantics

The extraction, the command line interface, the reverse-search implementation
and the DSH plugin wrapper are original work.

This project is not affiliated with Firaxis Games or 2K. It contains no
Civilization VI game assets.
